        "text": "<p>Quickly preview your sounds with live waveforms for fast, precise editing.<\/p><ul><li>Visualize audio files instantly with waveform previews.<\/li><li>Upload your own sfx or songs into the extension<\/li><li>Theme editor, rename tools, favorites, search, and more!<\/li><li>For DaVinci Resolve Studio, Premiere Pro, And After Effects<\/li><\/ul>",
        "button_label": "Learn More",
