        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Essential FX",
        "text": "<p>Version 3.5 (updates included)<\/p><p>Adobe After Effects<\/p><p><strong>Automated Speed Ramps<\/strong> – No keyframes needed, with custom curves and a reverse motion feature.<\/p><p><strong>Instant Transitions & VFX<\/strong> – Apply effects at the cursor with over 50 overlays, including fire and particles.<\/p><p><strong>Workflow Automation<\/strong> – One-click adjustment layers, keyframe smoothing, and real-time previews.<\/p>",
        "button_label": "Learn More",
        "button_link": "https:\/\/djordanmedia.com\/collections\/essentials\/products\/essentialfx-1",
        "button_style": "primary",
